# Table exports taken by the migration scripts before they write — a verbatim dump of a live
# stage, real golfer names and Cognito subs included. It is a restore path, never an artifact.
# `prod-backup-` is scripts/migrateProdStrokes.mjs; `swng-backup-` is
# scripts/migrateRoundPlayedAt.mjs, which migrates beta as well as prod and so does not call every
# export "prod". Both prefixes are pinned to these rules by scripts/migrateRoundPlayedAt.test.mjs.
prod-backup-*.json
swng-backup-*.json
